  "notes": "### Added\n- Instructions for the assistant: Markdown files in Pyxida/Agent (or notes and folders you choose) that Ask Pyxida and connected agents always follow. Manage them in Settings.\n- Resize the sidebar, the notes list and the editor and preview split by dragging. Pyxida remembers the sizes.\n- Two new themes: Sepia and Midnight.\n- The desktop app checks in once a day with its version, so we know when fixes have reached everyone. No content is sent.\n\n### Changed\n- Pyxida opens in a larger window that fits your screen.\n\n### Fixed\n- Text no longer hides behind the line numbers after scrolling sideways in the editor.\n- Open System Settings for Mac Calendar access now opens the right page, and Pyxida notices the permission as soon as you come back, without a restart.",
